WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.650
In old cartoons, everyone had a devil on one shoulder and an angel on the other.

2
00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.000
The devil always spoke first.

3
00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:14.600
He was louder, and his ideas sounded better.

4
00:00:15.625 --> 00:00:18.375
Usually, he got his way by lunch.

5
00:00:19.625 --> 00:00:23.725
The angel waited, then said something small and true.

6
00:00:24.750 --> 00:00:28.450
Most of the time, the man in the suit didn't listen.

7
00:00:29.450 --> 00:00:32.425
We laughed, because we knew how that went.

8
00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:35.850
You still have both.

9
00:00:36.800 --> 00:00:39.400
They just stopped wearing costumes.

10
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:43.200
One of them is talking right now.

11
00:00:44.750 --> 00:00:47.000
It's probably the loud one.
